{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":55,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["上帝施恩典"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"「來吧！所有口渴的人啊，來喝水吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有錢的人啊，來買東西吃吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"來買酒買奶吧，不花錢，不付費！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們為什麼花錢買不能吃的食物？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為什麼拿辛苦賺來的錢買不能令人飽足的東西？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要留心聽我的話，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就可以吃美物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"享受豐盛的佳餚。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要到我這裡來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"側耳聽我的話，就必存活。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要跟你們立永遠的約，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將應許大衛的可靠恩福賜給你們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，我使他向萬民作見證，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"立他作萬民的領袖和統帥。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，你必召集素不認識的國民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不認識你的國民必來投奔你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為以色列的聖者——你的上帝耶和華賜給你榮耀。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"要趁著還可以找到耶和華的時候尋找祂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"趁祂還在附近的時候求告祂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願邪惡的人停止作惡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不義的人除掉惡念。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願他們歸向耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必憐憫他們；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願他們歸向我們的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必大施赦免。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：「我的意念並非你們的意念，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的道路並非你們的道路。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"正如天高過地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的道路也高過你們的道路，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的意念也高過你們的意念。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雨雪從天降下，並不返回，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"而是要滋潤大地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使地上的植物發芽生長，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫播種的有種子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吃飯的有食糧。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"同樣，我口中所出的話也不會徒然返回，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"而是要成就我的旨意，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"實現我的計劃。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們必歡歡喜喜地出來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"平平安安地蒙引導，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大山小山都要在你們面前歌唱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"田野的樹木也都拍掌。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"曾經的荊棘之地必長出松樹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"曾經的蒺藜之地必長出番石榴。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這必使耶和華揚名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是永遠長存的記號。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/55.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/56.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/54.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}